# Earthlore can strengthen its controller's blocking creature (CR 115.1c, 611.2a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Earthlore
Memnite
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Earthlore.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
